Error [E3401]: `read_first` calls the impure function `read_line`
  --> tests/ui/stdin_pure_e3401.jet:6:21
    |
  6 |     line :: &handle.read_line()
    |                     ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `read_line` is impure, but `read_first` declares `-[]>`
 Fix: Remove the call from `read_first`, or drop the `-[]>` bound from `read_first` so its effects are inferred
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: read_first → read_line
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3401
